{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"cdc73e6c33701600","type":"group","x":-40,"y":-40,"width":500,"height":900,"color":"5","label":"START HERE"},
		{"id":"cfe264ac953e8ec4","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"5","text":"# Product delivery control\n\nRequest → **adopted evidence** without losing intent or connections.\n\nFewer / connected / adopted — in that order. Killing work at Gate 1 is success."},
		{"id":"e2efc02b36833f57","type":"text","x":0,"y":180,"width":420,"height":340,"text":"## 04/09 overlay vs `888ba3c`\n\n- **254** commits `888ba3c` → `2f82696`\n- Blocking **CI exists** — remote-run unverified\n- Cron **13** source calls — installed runtime unknown (TD-45)\n- Canonical **BL-01–88** (62 table rows ≠ 88 IDs)\n- Canonical **TD-01–57**\n- Next-free unused **BL-89 / TD-58 — do not mint**"},
		{"id":"243872762593c465","type":"text","x":0,"y":540,"width":420,"height":300,"color":"1","text":"## Open risks\n\n- App Review (TD-01)\n- No observability (TD-06)\n- No Meta ad-creation idempotency (TD-53 / BL-81)\n- Ghost-ads residual journal window\n- Dirty tree is in-flight, not shipped"},
		{"id":"6e07bb49e877229c","type":"group","x":520,"y":-40,"width":2520,"height":280,"color":"4","label":"Delivery spine"},
		{"id":"7b96edc029120618","type":"text","x":560,"y":0,"width":340,"height":200,"text":"## 1 · Request\n\nClassify evidence first.\nCommit ≠ runtime ≠ adoption."},
		{"id":"d3ed60ef4a378bc5","type":"text","x":960,"y":0,"width":340,"height":200,"text":"## 2 · Intake\n\nName BL/TD or the absence.\nSearch inbound refs before allocating an ID."},
		{"id":"3b0c40f3991c22ed","type":"text","x":1360,"y":0,"width":340,"height":200,"color":"1","text":"## 3 · Gate 1 · B1–B9\n\nPersona, pain, KPI, BL, adoption, unused signal, smallest version.\nPark is success."},
		{"id":"c56aba66203ec0ed","type":"text","x":1760,"y":0,"width":340,"height":200,"color":"1","text":"## 4 · Gate 2 · 8-plane\n\nReverse trace. Deferred seam costs a TD/BL — or an explicit unresolved owner."},
		{"id":"3a30d21537516bcc","type":"text","x":2160,"y":0,"width":340,"height":200,"text":"## 5 · Tracer + verify\n\nEnd-to-end outside the UI.\n`npm run test:contract` once at the end."},
		{"id":"da2b8b9d19eb0024","type":"text","x":2560,"y":0,"width":340,"height":200,"color":"4","text":"## 6 · Adopted\n\nShipped ≠ connected ≠ adopted.\nNot adopted is a finding. Removal is allowed."},
		{"id":"6c5e3c84b796db0d","type":"group","x":1320,"y":300,"width":1220,"height":280,"color":"1","label":"Hard-stop / denial / unknown"},
		{"id":"2952449d80cae1d0","type":"text","x":1360,"y":340,"width":340,"height":200,"color":"1","text":"## Parked\n\nGate 1 kill. No spec. No ID minted to satisfy the gate."},
		{"id":"8a3df56dec9d144b","type":"text","x":1760,"y":340,"width":340,"height":200,"color":"3","text":"## Unknown\n\nInterrupted Meta write stays `unknown`.\nNever rewrite as failed / zero / healthy."},
		{"id":"c574fbc847119059","type":"text","x":2160,"y":340,"width":340,"height":200,"color":"3","text":"## Retry only if absent\n\nReconcile against Meta first (BL-81 unbuilt).\nDo not relaunch the whole batch."},
		{"id":"bc0e9f062ec1dbee","type":"group","x":520,"y":300,"width":740,"height":280,"color":"6","label":"Evidence rail"},
		{"id":"a2cde21ba2429042","type":"text","x":560,"y":340,"width":660,"height":200,"color":"6","text":"## Evidence classes\n\n`main` commit = shipped code.\nBranch-only = unshipped.\nDirty tree = in-flight.\nRuntime/DB/Meta beats code.\nChat proves attempt, not landing."},
		{"id":"83ec96f3d35eab49","type":"group","x":520,"y":640,"width":2520,"height":300,"color":"3","label":"Ghost-ads 25/08/2026 — 27 intended → 42 live"},
		{"id":"e719d5cc60c68edf","type":"text","x":560,"y":680,"width":580,"height":220,"color":"3","text":"## Timeline (measured)\n\n16:57 clean fail, 0 ads\n16:59–17:00 **15 ads**, UI said 0\n17:15 `b4ceb34` timeout/chunk — mitigation, not root cause\n17:21 relaunch 27 → total **42**"},
		{"id":"a35e84ec9c4f84d7","type":"text","x":1200,"y":680,"width":900,"height":220,"text":"## Structural ordering\n\n1. Open `launch_batches` `in_flight` **before** first Meta write\n2. Journal each ad ID as Meta returns it\n3. Interrupted request = `unknown`\n4. Retry only rows proven absent\n5. Residual window remains (no true idempotency key)"},
		{"id":"6226473cb9616063","type":"text","x":2160,"y":680,"width":840,"height":220,"color":"1","text":"## Still unbuilt\n\nBL-81 reconcile · TD-53 one-ad journal window · TD-54 other ads-creating paths still write-before-record.\n\nTimeout/chunk tuning ≠ root-cause fix."},
		{"id":"e7775ed5cc94eb2c","type":"group","x":-40,"y":920,"width":3080,"height":280,"color":"2","label":"Learning loop — incident → correct → prevent"},
		{"id":"8603e34299f8b79a","type":"text","x":0,"y":960,"width":720,"height":200,"text":"## Skills actually used\n\n254 invocations / 40 names in 04/08–03/09 corpus (indexed, not line-by-line).\nTop: codebase-memory 40 · vault-system-thinking 31 · vault-knowledge-retrieval 23 · build-connected 17.\n`/archify` was observed, missing from Skills Index until 04/09."},
		{"id":"a4af5a1736268401","type":"text","x":780,"y":960,"width":720,"height":200,"text":"## Controls this loop bought\n\nSearch inbound refs before allocating IDs.\nMissing query output ≠ absence.\nKeep historical AS-IS; overlay current; never rewrite 25–28/07.\nVerify once at the end."},
		{"id":"d234a9fb299aae84","type":"file","x":1560,"y":960,"width":420,"height":200,"file":"Knowledge/playbooks/product-development-framework.md"},
		{"id":"62498c3428f0e0b3","type":"file","x":2040,"y":960,"width":420,"height":200,"file":"Projects/AdLauncher/architecture/decisions/0002-business-and-connection-gates-before-build.md"},
		{"id":"b7dba35cee55ee8e","type":"file","x":2520,"y":960,"width":480,"height":200,"file":"Projects/AdLauncher/postmortems/2026-08-25-ghost-ads-27-thanh-42.md"}
	],
